            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "链表数很多 → 数组初始化长度不合理（默认扩容逻辑导致）"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "Map 很大 → 事先未定义好初始化长度"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "经验公式：存储 10000 条数据时，容量取 10000 × 1.34 = 13400，向上取2 的幂次方 = 16384 作为初始容量即可（不需要按扩容到 20000 预留）"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
